	(descr "SOT-23-8 - U5, the INA219AIDCNR current monitor. 1 IN+, 2 IN-, 3 GND, 4 VS, 5 SCL, 6 SDA, 7 A0, 8 A1 (TI SBOS448G rev G, December 2015, page 3). THE PADS ARE TI'S OWN RECOMMENDED LAND, not the stock outline: 0.45 x 1.10 mm on the 0.65 mm pitch with the rows 2.60 mm apart (TI LAND PATTERN DATA, DCN R-PDSO-G8, drawing 4211034/C, 07/2013), which leaves 0.20 mm between adjacent pins where KiCad's 0.50 mm pads left 0.15. The courtyard grows 0.05 mm each side with them. Closes docs/V5-SPEC.md sec 9.2 item 6.")
